  "editorial": {
    "name": "Calmo UI",
    "descriptionZh": "React + TypeScript 组件库，组件按仪表盘、设置流程、弹层、表格这类产品界面切分，自带主题预设与给 AI 用的元数据包。",
    "descriptionEn": null,
    "takeawayZh": "npm 装 calmo-ui，拿到 126 个产品界面组件",
    "noteZh": "首屏左边是 DOCS 目录，Overview 下面把组件分成 Layout / Navigation / Icons / Actions / Forms / Feedback / Overlays / Data & Lists / Utilities 九组；中间大标题写 The React component library for calm product surfaces.，右边一块 Install 面板给出 npm install calmo-ui 和 Copy 按钮，并排三格写 126+ documented components、5 theme presets、AI prompt + metadata bundle。下方 WHY CALMO 一段有四张卡：Production UI coverage、TypeScript-first ergonomics、AI-friendly by default、Calm product direction，再往下是 Dashboard starter、Settings and account app、Finance sheet flow 三个示例应用。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
